{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Farmch Revolution</strong> is an action roguelike game that combines the Skill system of an AOS with the progression system of a roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the full game, you can upgrade unique Skills of various characters to unpredictable levels and endlessly enjoy synergies with Items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo to get a small taste of those infinite possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please join our Discord to provide feedback and report bugs! Your participation is a great help in creating more fun and diverse content faster! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Demo Contents Details</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content available in this demo is as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Playable Characters:</strong> You can play as 4 characters, each with different charms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Skills:</strong> Each character can use 5 unique Skills, just like in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Growth Elements:</strong> In the current demo, you can experience over 130 Items and over 340 total Skill Upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous Updates:</strong> The demo will be continuously updated so you can experience Items and Skill Upgrades on the almost same level as the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the synergy of Upgrades and Items in advance, and look forward to the upcoming full version of Farmch Revolution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Stages &amp; Enemies (Demo Scope: 3 Stages)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can play a total of 3 stages, including the hidden stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the upcoming full version of Farmch Revolution, 8+ stages, various enemies, and powerful Bosses await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120670?t=1762797797","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120670?t=1762797797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120670/0d28c9c448cb11cf9d6023dd9c3a69cdb352e081/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762797797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120670/0d28c9c448cb11cf9d6023dd9c3a69cdb352e081/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762797797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce2 <strong>Farmch Revolution</strong> is an action roguelike game that combines the Skill system of an AOS with the progression system of a roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the full game, you can upgrade unique Skills of various characters to unpredictable levels and endlessly enjoy synergies with Items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo to get a small taste of those infinite possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please join our Discord to provide feedback and report bugs! Your participation is a great help in creating more fun and diverse content faster! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Demo Contents Details</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content available in this demo is as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Playable Characters:</strong> You can play as 4 characters, each with different charms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Skills:</strong> Each character can use 5 unique Skills, just like in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast Growth Elements:</strong> In the current demo, you can experience over 130 Items and over 340 total Skill Upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous Updates:</strong> The demo will be continuously updated so you can experience Items and Skill Upgrades on the almost same level as the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the synergy of Upgrades and Items in advance, and look forward to the upcoming full version of Farmch Revolution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Stages &amp; Enemies (Demo Scope: 3 Stages)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can play a total of 3 stages, including the hidden stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the upcoming full version of Farmch Revolution, 8+ stages, various enemies, and powerful Bosses await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hardroll"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4118860","name":"Farmch Revolution"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120670/2c